Bernadette wants to arrive 5 minutes before Wayne. To find out how early Bernadette should leave, we subtract the 5 minutes from the total time Bernadette will spend driving:
\[
16 \text{ minutes} - 5 \text{ minutes} = 11 \text{ minutes}
